<<<
local(e). 1. The ‘ erroneous form’ (OED) locale is recommended; see MORALE, & A L’OUTRANCE. 2. Pronounce the noun lokah‘’l, whichever way it is spelt. 3. The word’s right to exist depends on the question whether the two indispensable words locality & scene give all the shades of meaning required, or whether something intermediate is useful.
===
**local(e).** 1. The 'erroneous form' (OED) *locale* is recommended; see ^^MORALE^^, & ^^À L'OUTRANCE^^. 2. Pronounce the noun lokah'l, whichever way it is spelt. 3. The word's right to exist depends on the question whether the two indispensable words *locality* & *scene* give all the shades of meaning required, or whether something intermediate is useful.
>>>

